# TrailCurrent Power Dashboard — local/generated state.
#
# Tracked: the .eez-project, the font assets it embeds, the hand-written C in
# main/ (including main/UI/actions.c, vars.c and dash_data.c), and the build
# configuration. Not tracked: anything a build downloads or emits.

# AI agent configuration (local only — never commit)
.claude
.claude/
.claude.md
CLAUDE.md
CLAUDE.MD
.cursorrules
.cursor/
.github/copilot*
.aider*
.continue/
.codeium/
.tabnine*
.sourcery.yaml

# --- ESP-IDF ---------------------------------------------------------------
build/
sdkconfig
sdkconfig.old
dependencies.lock
managed_components/

# --- EEZ Studio ------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-project editor UI state (which page/panel was open) — noise in a diff.
*.eez-project-ui-state

# Backups left by EEZ Studio's own saves and by the generator script.
*.eez-project.bak
*.eez-project.bak[0-9]
*.eez-project.bak.*

# The Docker simulator extracts its WebAssembly build next to the project.
.docker-build-output/
.emscripten-cache/

# EEZ Studio's manifest of the files it generated, used to clean up stale ones
# on the next export. Regenerated every time, so it only churns the diff.
main/UI/.eez-project-build

# NOTE: main/UI/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The EEZ Studio export is
# committed so a clone builds without opening EEZ Studio first, and because
# main/UI/ also holds the hand-written actions.c / vars.c / dash_data.c.

# --- Local working state ---------------------------------------------------
# One-shot generator and patch scripts. Reusable tooling belongs in the
# eezstudio skill, not in the repo.
tmp/
GUI/tmp/
**/tmp/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# --- Editors / OS ----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
*.log

# EEZ Studio writes this sidecar when settings.general.cacheFonts is on.
*.eez-project-fonts-cache
